    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After blood sense Gu reports a direction and distance, Lord Sky Crane orders Fang Zheng to use blood scar Gu to mark the position. Blood scar Gu has an extremely large demand for primeval essence. Successful activation requires lasting for ten breaths of time.",
        "chapters": [
          669
        ],
