          "gu_blood_sense_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the drill shown, Fang Zheng still has enough primeval essence in his rank five aperture but can mobilize only a small portion into blood scar Gu. He persists for eight breaths, then collapses unconscious into the blood pool, two breaths short of success. Lord Sky Crane reports that earlier progress and that remaining gap to He Feng Yang.",
        "chapters": [
          669
